COMMAND DISCOVERY
Every action lists its exact noninteractive CLI equivalent. Enter opens the guided form; esc closes.
/deploy

> Preview a deployment         -   deployment.plan
    cli: eregion platform deployments plan <app> <environment> --release-id <release> --json
  Deploy release               d   deployment.deploy · destructive
    cli: eregion platform deployments deploy <app> <environment> --release-id <release>
    --idempotency-key <key> --json
  Roll back environment        o   deployment.rollback · destructive
    cli: eregion platform deployments rollback <app> <environment> --confirm <plan-token>
    --idempotency-key <key> --json
j/k move · type filter · enter open · esc close




















